sword">Password</label><input id="request-password" class="login-input" type="password" minlength="8" required placeholder="At least 8 characters"></div></div><div class="login-field"><label for="request-justification">Reason for access</label><textarea id="request-justification" class="login-input" style="height:80px;padding-top:12px" placeholder="Briefly describe your examination-office responsibility"></textarea></div><button id="request-submit" class="login-submit" type="submit"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Submit account request</button></form><div class="login-foot"><i class="fas fa-hourglass-half"></i> An administrator must approve your request before you can sign in.</div></div></div></div>
